sequenceDiagram
    participant usr_employee as "Employee"
    participant ui_app as "mobile-app (Compose)"
    participant svc_api as "api (FastAPI)"
    participant db_postgres as "PostgreSQL"
    ui_app->>svc_api: GET /api/incidents - Authorization Bearer JWT
    Note over svc_api: owner filter from token subject - no client parameter can widen it (INSTR-001, BR-009)
    svc_api->>db_postgres: SELECT incidents WHERE owner_id ORDER BY created_at DESC - no pagination (BR-019, BR-020)
    db_postgres-->>svc_api: owned incident rows (list items omit description)
    svc_api-->>ui_app: 200 JSON array newest first
    ui_app-->>usr_employee: S-02 cards - loading, empty Sin incidencias, or error+retry states
    opt employee taps a filter chip - Todas Pendiente En progreso Resuelta (FUNC-004)
        ui_app->>svc_api: GET /api/incidents?status=pending (or in_progress, resolved, all)
        svc_api-->>ui_app: 200 filtered owned array - chip counts update live (BR-017)
    end
    opt employee taps an incident card
        ui_app->>svc_api: GET /api/incidents/{id}
        alt owner and exists
            svc_api->>db_postgres: SELECT incident + incident_history WHERE incident_id ORDER BY changed_at ASC (BR-021)
            db_postgres-->>svc_api: detail row + history rows
            svc_api-->>ui_app: 200 incident with description + history array
            ui_app-->>usr_employee: open S-04 Detalle de incidencia - Historial de estados timeline
        else missing or foreign id - indistinguishable safe response
            svc_api-->>ui_app: 404 detail Incidencia no encontrada
            ui_app-->>usr_employee: safe no-access state - Incidencia no disponible (BR-010)
        end
    end
    opt token failure on any call
        svc_api-->>ui_app: 401 detail No autenticado
        Note over ui_app: expired-token recovery flow - route S-01 (network errors instead keep error+retry, CONF-009)
    end
